["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/nli", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "[Natural Location Identifier (NLI)](https://eccma.org/enli-eccma-natural-location-identifier/) is a 14- or 15-character alphanumeric string standardized by [ISO 8000-118](https://www.iso.org/standard/85428.html) that uniquely identifies a three-dimensional geographic point location. The identifier is generated from geodetic coordinates and elevation data. For electronic storage, the `ISO.NLI:` prefix shall be retained (e.g., `ISO.NLI:41TS8M-A8ELTQ-H2`).", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["_:N431a3dbec2bb4f57860e5814a51fe528", "http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#hasValue", "https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Software/SoftwareArtifact", "globalId", "", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Service/SoftwareService", "http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#property", "_:Nf7999a71cd8248a6a104c94d2a9f85cb", "localId", "", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/RelationshipType/amendedBy", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type", "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual", "globalId", "", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/isan", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "[International Standard Audiovisual Number (ISAN)](https://www.isan.org/about/#what_is_isan) is a unique 24-digit hexadecimal identifier for audiovisual works standardized by [ISO 15706](https://www.iso.org/standard/83124.html). The ISAN remains persistent for a work regardless of its distribution format or its use. To facilitate human readability, the \"ISAN\" label, grouping hyphens, and two check characters are included (e.g., `ISAN 0000-0000-3A8D-0000-Z-0000-0000-6`); however, these elements shall be omitted when the identifier is stored electronically (e.g., `000000003A8D000000000000`).", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/AI/AIPackage", "http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#property", "_:N920d90ca672d471c90079eea8434c9a9", "localId", "", ""]
